WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.628 --> 00:00:04.100
Start here with Velstrian Bid.

2
00:00:04.741 --> 00:00:09.808
Welcome to Velstrian Bid. Your home page
shows what needs you first,

3
00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:15.095
ordered by how soon it is due. Open any
item to go straight to the work.

4
00:00:15.095 --> 00:00:18.700
Here are the first three things to do.

5
00:00:19.328 --> 00:00:23.755
First, add your documents to the evidence
vault, such as policies,

6
00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:30.200
case studies and insurance, so every
answer is drafted from your own material.

7
00:00:30.815 --> 00:00:34.020
Second, find contracts that suit you.

8
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:38.799
The feed lists live tenders, ranked by how
well they match your recent bids,

9
00:00:38.799 --> 00:00:42.000
and you can save the ones you want.

10
00:00:42.615 --> 00:00:46.003
Third, start a bid. Upload the tender,

11
00:00:46.003 --> 00:00:50.247
and Velstrian Bid lists its questions and
drafts an answer to each one,

12
00:00:50.247 --> 00:00:53.133
for you to check and approve.

13
00:00:53.761 --> 00:00:58.733
Need a hand? Open Help and support at any
time.

